has function MlirFunction
has position Number
constant Joined = TypeCodegen("Strict/A", ("Run(path Text) Text", "\tText.Combine(File(path).ReadLines, \"\\n\")"), ValueCodegen.NoTypes, List(Text)).Entry
constant Reading = MlirReadText(MlirFunction(List(TypeEntry) + Joined, Joined, Joined.methods.First), 4)
constant Steps = Reading.function.method.instructions
Helper(helper Text) Text
	Reading.Helper("strict_file_read_lines") is "strict_file_read_lines" and Reading.Helper("x") is "x"
	if helper is "strict_file_read_lines" and IsRead
		return "strict_file_joined"
	helper is "strict_text_combine" and IsJoin then "strict_file_joined_result" else helper
IsRead Boolean
	Reading.IsRead is false and MlirReadText(Reading.function, -1).IsRead is false
	steps = function.method.instructions
	if position < 0 or position + 3 >= steps.Length
		return false
	read = steps(position)
	if IsCall(read, "File", "ReadLines") is false
		return false
	check = steps(position + 1)
	Matches(read, check, steps(position + 2), steps(position + 3)) and IsUnused(read.payload(0), position + 3)
Matches(read InstructionEntry, check InstructionEntry, literal InstructionEntry, join InstructionEntry) Boolean
	Reading.Matches(Steps(4), Steps(6), Steps(6), Steps(7)) is false
	if check.kind is not InstructionType.CheckError or check.payload(0) is not read.payload(0)
		return false
	if literal.kind is not InstructionType.LoadConstantToRegister
		return false
	if PayloadDecoder(literal).Value(1).text is not "\n" or IsCall(join, "Text", "Combine") is false
		return false
	LoadReuse(function.method.instructions).Reads(join) is (read.payload(0), literal.payload(0))
IsUnused(register Number, joined Number) Boolean
	Reading.IsUnused(Steps(4).payload(0), 7)
	steps = function.method.instructions
	if LoadReuse(steps).Write(steps(joined)) is register
		return true
	for Range(joined + 1, steps.Length)
		result = Outcome(steps(value), register)
		if result is not 0
			return result > 0
	true
Outcome(entry InstructionEntry, register Number) Number
	Reading.Outcome(Steps(9), 99) is 1 and Reading.Outcome(Steps(7), Steps(4).payload(0)) is Number.NotFound
	reuse = LoadReuse(function.method.instructions)
	if register is in reuse.Reads(entry)
		return Number.NotFound
	if reuse.Write(entry) is register or entry.kind is InstructionType.Return
		return 1
	reuse.IsBoundary(entry) and entry.kind is not InstructionType.CheckError then Number.NotFound else 0
IsCall(entry InstructionEntry, owner Text, name Text) Boolean
	Reading.IsCall(Steps(4), "File", "ReadLines") and Reading.IsCall(Steps(6), "File", "ReadLines") is false
	if entry.kind is not InstructionType.Invoke or entry.texts.Length < 3
		return false
	TypeEntry.ShortName(entry.texts(0)) is owner and entry.texts(1) is name
IsJoin Boolean
	position >= 3 and MlirReadText(function, position - 3).IsRead